WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.752 --> 00:00:04.629
Hey, Mik-Mik! Are you ready?

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:06.131
Get me down this second!

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:07.257
You asked for it!

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.350
All I want is a simple life.

00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:19.310
You’re always unhappy.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.105
I wanted you to wake up from your slumber!

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.823
Is that a baby grizzly? How did he get here?

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:35.785
It must’ve been misdelivered.

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:37.579
I suggest that we all help Carl...

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:39.622
No no, don’t say another word.

00:00:39.622 --> 00:00:41.166
…deliver this baby grizzly.

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:43.126
Nooooooooo!!!

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:46.129
Lets go!

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:48.882
They’re waiting on a stork 

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:52.343
to deliver a baby to this grizzly fool.

00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:54.471
Someone needs to steal the baby.

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:57.098
That will show them not to mess with me.

00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:58.683
How many of them are there?

00:00:59.100 --> 00:00:59.726
A bear.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:00.894
Is anyone hungry?

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:01.770
A hare.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.354
Stop yelling at me, Mik-Mik.

00:01:03.354 --> 00:01:04.689
It’s bad for your complexion.

00:01:05.523 --> 00:01:06.232
A stork.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.485
What’s wrong? Can’t catch up?

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:13.990
And some weird creature with black spots under its eyes.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:15.992
I am the giant panda wizard.

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.750
Carl, what does your inner GPS say?

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:25.877
Route calculated.

00:01:25.877 --> 00:01:26.711
It’s that way.

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:31.341
What’s going on? No no no!

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.096
The avalanche is catching up!

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:44.145
Hold my bear.

00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:48.316
Saving the world always gives me a headache.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:49.359
We’re going down!

00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:50.652
Prepare for impact!

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:54.531
From now on I’m flying first class.

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:55.782
Follow me!

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:58.618
This is outrageous!

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:00.328
I thought you wanted an adventure.

00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:06.334
Snow, winter.

00:02:06.334 --> 00:02:09.295
No no, it’s just cold summer.

00:02:10.588 --> 00:02:14.008
No, it’s not time for paw licking yet!

